<title>POLAND: Jutrzenka sees net up in next three years.</title>
<headline>Jutrzenka sees net up in next three years.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish confectioner Jutrzenka SA expects its net profit to rise to 15.4 million zlotys this year, to 22.5 million in 1998 and 31.2 million in 1999, up from last year's 10.3 million, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Jutrzenka said its sales were likely to grow to 175 milllion zlotys in 1997, 280 million in 1998 and to 390 million in 1999, from 127.9 million in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
